pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>07 具体方案/方法细节</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Context Binding：从 Raw PC 到 Annotated Event</strong></p>
  - elementId: input-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [4000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: input-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 118, 200, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>输入</strong></p>
  - elementId: input-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 150, 1120, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>Trace event 中的 PC 和 syscall id  +  目标 ELF 精确映射 code map（sections, symbols, source） +  Runtime OS map（process, loaded object）</p>
  - elementId: process-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 205, 1160, 280]
    columnWidths: [0.1, 0.25, 0.35, 0.3]
    rowHeights: [0.12, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.2]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "Step"}
        - content: {text: "处理"}
        - content: {text: "检查内容"}
        - content: {text: "输出"}
      - - content: {text: "1"}
        - content: {text: "静态匹配"}
        - content: {text: "PC 是否落在 target ELF 的 load range、section、symbol"}
        - content: {text: "binary, section, symbol"}
      - - content: {text: "2"}
        - content: {text: "运行时归属"}
        - content: {text: "PC 属于 target_child / runner_parent / kernel / ambiguous"}
        - content: {text: "process_owner"}
      - - content: {text: "3"}
        - content: {text: "ASLR/PIE 偏移"}
        - content: {text: "pc - load_base = offset"}
        - content: {text: "effective PC range"}
      - - content: {text: "4"}
        - content: {text: "fork/exec 跟踪"}
        - content: {text: "进程切换后 owner 更新"}
        - content: {text: "updated owner mapping"}
      - - content: {text: "结果"}
        - content: {text: "Annotated event"}
        - content: {text: "包含 binary, symbol, process_owner, source label"}
        - content: {text: "reportable / downgraded / blocked"}
  - elementId: bottom-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 505, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEF3C7"
  - elementId: bottom-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 515, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>约束</strong>：静态 annotation 只能说明"PC 在 target ELF 范围内"，不等于"这个事件属于 target child"。对于 fork/exec 链，必须有完整的 runtime map 证据。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>33</p>
